      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BULL DURHAM (8) copped a check in the run last time and never threatened when eighth (23.69) in a Grade 5 at this track. Tough to beat on best. ASTON KILLARA (2) showed good early burn and was there until turning but swamped late to finish 5th at Traralgon in Grade 5 H company. Key runner on best form. PAW ZENITH (5) turned in a modest effort most recently when seventh at Ballarat over 390m behind Black Statesman (22.78) in a Grade 5. Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. Great chance to atone. PAW QUINTESSA (4) saluted last start after racing on the speed. Hard to beat again.",
